  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Yarumy get the life she deserves</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At just 11 months old, little Yarumi suffered an accident that changed her life forever.  She fell from her baby walker into a plastic bathtub full of hot water, since that moment her recovery has been accompanied by different challenges that involve the physical and emotional spheres.  This project will provide little Yarumi with all the medical materials, surgeries, special garments and therapies to recover full left arm-hand flexibility, improve the scars of her face and body noticeably.</narrative>
  </description>
